<title>SWEDEN: Swedish FinMin says radio EMU report speculation.</title>
<headline>Swedish FinMin says radio EMU report speculation.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish Finance Minister Erik Asbrink described as speculation a Wednesday radio report saying Sweden would not join EMU in the mandate period 1998-2002 without new parliamentary elections.</p>
</text>
